---
# The kernel stand-in defines the kernel's C entry points at the kernel's own
# signatures, three of which take more parameters than the root threshold; the
# width is the FFI ABI's, so that one threshold is raised to it here and the
# check's other limits stay as the root sets them.
InheritParentConfig: true

CheckOptions:
  readability-function-size.ParameterThreshold: 12
